---
description: PDF processing limits, input validation, and secret management rules
globs: ["src/lib/pdf.ts", "src/app/api/**", ".env*"]
alwaysApply: false
---

- Enforce a 10 MB PDF size limit client-side before upload — reject with a descriptive message, not a generic error.
- If extracted PDF text is empty or < 100 characters, surface a specific error; do not proceed to call Claude.
- `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` lives in `.env.local` only — never commit, log, expose in client bundles, or return in API responses.
- No other secrets (tokens, keys) may appear in any committed file.
